{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Dust &amp; Diesel: Deadland Delivery Demo, where you\u2019ll take your first steps as a wasteland courier. Traverse brutal terrain, push your vehicle to the limit, and battle ruthless bandits trying to stop you. Get a taste of the full game blending tactical off-road driving, intense vehicular combat, and survival in a post-apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This Two-Part Demo Includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer challenging off-road routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and upgrade your truck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against ruthless bandits</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to become a legend of the wasteland? Download the demo and start your engine!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045840?t=1758909265","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045840?t=1758909265","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045840/2adffdac714e1eb94ac05f8f1e070dc2e0c1f1af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758909265","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045840/2adffdac714e1eb94ac05f8f1e070dc2e0c1f1af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758909265","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Dust &amp; Diesel: Deadland Delivery Demo, where you\u2019ll take your first steps as a wasteland courier. Traverse brutal terrain, push your vehicle to the limit, and battle ruthless bandits trying to stop you. Get a taste of the full game blending